# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC. Two categories must never be committed here:
#
#   1. Anything from the disc: executables, assets, audio, video, saves.
#   2. Code translated from the game binary: the generated C, and anything
#      derived from it (hand-written copies, decompiled bodies, symbol dumps
#      of game code).
#
# (2) is not a formality. Static recomp output is a derivative work of the
# game in the same practical sense as a matching decompilation, and it is the
# category that has drawn takedowns before. Keep it out and the repository
# stays on the same footing as every other bring-your-own-disc project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- game files: never here ---
*.iso
*.xiso
*.xbe
*.xex
*.dat
*.fat
*.bik
*.xwb
*.xpr
*.caf
*.sf
/game/
/disc/
/assets/

# --- generated C translated from the game: never here ---
src/recomp/gen/
/gen/
recomp_gen/
recomp_*.c
recomp_dispatch.c
recomp_funcs.h
recomp_types.h
# ...but the hand-written override layer and the host entry are project
# source, not translated code. Negate them explicitly: the `recomp_*.c`
# pattern above catches src/recomp_manual.c otherwise.
!src/recomp_manual.c

# --- analysis artifacts about the game binary: keep local ---
/analysis/
/functions.json
/xrefs.json
/strings.json
/abi_functions.json
image_symbols.h
*.seeds.json
xbox_kernel.log

# --- harness output: logs and captures stay local ---
/logs/
/reference/
*.ics
icall_targets.json

# --- the toolkit is fetched and pinned, not vendored ---
/xboxrecomp/
/tools/xboxrecomp/

# --- Prerequisites ---
*.d

# --- Compiled object files ---
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# --- Precompiled headers ---
*.gch
*.pch

# --- Linker files ---
*.ilk

# --- Debugger files ---
*.pdb

# --- Compiled dynamic libraries ---
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.so.*

# --- Fortran module files ---
*.mod
*.smod

# --- Compiled static libraries ---
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# --- Executables ---
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# --- Build directories ---
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uild-*/
cmake-build-*/

# --- CMake generated files ---
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json

# --- Temporary files ---
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp

# --- vcpkg ---
vcpkg_installed/

# --- debug information files ---
*.dwo

# --- test output & cache ---
Testing/
.cache/
__pycache__/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- editor/agent session data ---
# Project OpenCode surface is committed (commands, config); anything else
# OpenCode may drop locally stays out.
.opencode/*
!.opencode/commands/
!.opencode/commands/**

